; A jump back would run a declaration again, so implicit variables in a function with labels are left alone.
Function Countdown:Int32(start)
	value = start
	.again
	Print value
	value = value - 1
	If value > 0 Then Goto again
	Return 0
End Function

Print Countdown(3)
